<title>ITALY: Olivetti expected to make conference call.</title>
<headline>Olivetti expected to make conference call.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1996-09-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italian information technology group Olivetti is expected to organise a conference call for 1600 GMT on Wednesday to give details of results and explain the group's current situation, Milan and London analysts said.</p>
<p>No confirmation of the conference call was available from the group's headquarters in the north western town of Ivrea.</p>
<p>Olivetti chairman Carlo De Benedetti resigned from his post and from the group's board late on Tuesday. Olivetti announced a 440.2 billion lire pre-tax loss for the first half of 1996.</p>
</text>
